    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Train the best, most powerful Lamias!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLD</h2>In an impoverished demon world ravaged by the war between man and beast, the Lamia tribe are on the verge of extinction.<br><br>Ivy, reincarnated into the demon world as the Lamia tribe's savior, along with princess Hedera aim for the revival of their tribe. Play as Ivy as you multiply and raise Lamias and battle the Harpy tribe to reclaim the Lamia Palace.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077680/extras/253f7860971640355098ae2f43fec608.avif?t=1738321378\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DUNGEONS</h2>Battles take place in demon world dungeons with familiar 2D maps. Explore the dungeons again and again and defeat the bosses waiting in their depths.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077680/extras/9b1aba6f6f955427842f5d6434a891d6.avif?t=1738321378\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BATTLES</h2>Classic command-style turn-based battles. The key to good battle strategy is to form your party to take advantage of each Lamia's characteristics, choosing from Lamias skilled at physical attacks to those specializing in magic attacks. Lead your Lamias to victory.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077680/extras/a8eb88c8878c88c4846c514d90e98c85.avif?t=1738321378\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUTE CHARACTERS</h2>Not only will you find Lamias, but you'll also see Harpies, Fairies, and other familiar monsters complete with up-tempo*** conversations and stories in an enjoyable pixel art demon world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077680/extras/5cb82ebee6d3deb28ab0ae14054f7874.avif?t=1738321378\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077680/extras/7e3404789a51ba883522f6d2be89ed19.avif?t=1738321378\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LAMIA TRAINING SYSTEM</h2>The Lamia training system is scheduled to be released in Summer 2024, when Japan is scorching hot.<br><br>Don't miss the latest Lamia's Bambina (&quot;LamiBam&quot;) information!",
